## Core build outputs
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Log]s/

## Visual Studio working files
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## VS Code settings and workspace files
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json

## Rider / JetBrains IDEs
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## ASP.NET Core specific exclusions
### Local secrets management (NEVER commit secrets to source control)
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
secrets.json

### Frontend build artifacts (if using Angular, React, etc.)
node_modules/
/wwwroot/dist/
dist/

### Compiled publish output
/publish/
/out/

## Operating system files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

## Unity-проект (Unity/) - генерируемое не версионируем
/Unity/[Ll]ibrary/
/Unity/[Tt]emp/
/Unity/[Oo]bj/
/Unity/[Bb]uild*/
/Unity/[Ll]ogs/
/Unity/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/Unity/ClientSimStorage/
/Unity/*.sln
/Unity/*.csproj
/Unity/.vs/

### Результат компиляции UdonSharp, ~107 МБ. Пересобирается при первом открытии.
/Unity/Assets/SerializedUdonPrograms/
/Unity/Assets/SerializedUdonPrograms.meta

### Пакеты ставит VCC по манифестам - в репо едут только они
/Unity/Packages/*
!/Unity/Packages/manifest.json
!/Unity/Packages/vpm-manifest.json
!/Unity/Packages/packages-lock.json

### Настройки окружений - в них строки подключения и токены
/VQueries/VQueries/appsettings.Alpha.json
/VQueries/VQueries/appsettings.Production.json
